KrakenTest
└── fetchFromKraken
    ├── given a successful response
    │   ├── it parses the real X/Z-prefixed pair keys
    │   ├── it also accepts unprefixed pair keys
    │   ├── it inverts the quote into ZEC-per-fiat
    │   └── it names itself as the source
    ├── given a key that is not a ZEC pair
    │   └── it ignores that key
    ├── given the same currency appears twice
    │   └── it keeps the first
    ├── given a pair with no usable price
    │   └── it ignores that pair
    ├── given the response has no result at all
    │   └── it throws
    ├── given an API-level error
    │   └── it throws
    ├── given no usable pairs are present
    │   └── it throws
    └── given an HTTP error
        └── it throws
